
a
;; Starting from 1, repeatedly multiplies by 2 in binary, effectively by shifting the initial
;; 1 left position by position. Will continue until it reaches 2^2049, which is a large number.
;; Note that since the tape moves in a single direction (left), this is an O(N) program in terms
;; of performance (time complexity), unlike the other examples which are all O(N^2).
a null P:1 b
b 1 P:0 L P:1 b
